cely done! You've got a knack for this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_clay_04_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_clay_04_78","text":"Hehe, thanks!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_clay_04_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_clay_04_79","text":"Oh, dear... I can already see Anis being a bad influence on Clay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_clay_04_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_clay_04_80","text":"Here, get up. I'll show you how to relax in a healthy way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_clay_04_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_clay_04_81","text":"Pssh, I bet all you're gonna do is give her one of your endless lectures on firepower.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_clay_04_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_clay_04_82","text":"No, I'm not!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_clay_04_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_clay_04_83","text":"Now, if you want to relax in a way that's good for you, you've got to cultivate some healthy hobbies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_clay_04_84"